{"kind": "question", "qid": "watch_d#0", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "8", "answer": "The guidebook demonstrates **9** incorrect postures for measuring blood pressure. On the page titled \"Incorrect postures when measuring blood pressure\", there is a grid of 3 columns \u00d7 3 rows of figures, each showing a different wrong posture with an \"\u2715\" mark under it (9 total).\n\nFor reference, the same section also notes that incorrect measurement postures can yield higher results, e.g. sitting cross-legged, on a low sofa or in front of a low table, or placing the watch below the heart.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 14, "bbox": {"x0": 0.09, "y0": 0.06, "x1": 0.85, "y1": 0.11}}, {"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 14, "bbox": {"x0": 0.11, "y0": 0.17, "x1": 0.55, "y1": 0.6}}, {"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 12, "bbox": {"x0": 0.06, "y0": 0.31, "x1": 0.93, "y1": 0.4}}], "ranked": ["watch_d/p014", "watch_d/p012", "watch_d/p013", "watch_d/p016", "watch_d/p001"], "pool": ["watch_d/p012", "watch_d/p013", "watch_d/p014", "watch_d/p016", "watch_d/p001", "watch_d/p011", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p012", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p016", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p000", "watch_d/p005", "watch_d/p015", "watch_d/p018", "watch_d/p006", "watch_d/p003", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p002", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p000", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p006", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p013", "watch_d/p022", "watch_d/p002", "watch_d/p019", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p005", "watch_d/p007"], "ndcg_at_k": 1.0, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 5, "calls": 16, "tokens": 200120, "stop_reason": "recover_exhausted", "latency_s": 42.444}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "watch_d#1", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "2.5-3cm", "answer": "According to the figure, the two fingers' distance is 2.5\u20133 cm.\n\nThe instruction says: \"At a position on your wrist that is about the width of two fingers away from the bottom of your palm, put the end of the ruler that comes with the watch through the buckle on the head.\" The accompanying illustration labels this two-finger spacing from the bottom of the palm as \"2.5-3 cm,\" marked with a dashed line and the ruler placed at that position on the wrist.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 5, "bbox": {"x0": 0.152, "y0": 0.291, "x1": 0.722, "y1": 0.567}}], "ranked": ["watch_d/p006", "watch_d/p005", "watch_d/p003", "watch_d/p002", "watch_d/p007"], "pool": ["watch_d/p006", "watch_d/p005", "watch_d/p013", "watch_d/p003", "watch_d/p011", "watch_d/p019", "watch_d/p022", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p022", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p006", "watch_d/p001", "watch_d/p014"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.6309, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 4, "calls": 13, "tokens": 88666, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 22.604}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "watch_d#2", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "2", "answer": "Two steps are needed to customize the function of the Down button:\n\n1. Press the Up button to open the app list and then go to **Settings** > **Down button**.\n2. Select an app and customize the function of the Down button. After you have finished customizing the function, return to the home screen and press the Down button to open the current app.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 8, "bbox": {"x0": 0.07, "y0": 0.87, "x1": 0.89, "y1": 0.93}}, {"doc_id": "watch_d", "page": 9, "bbox": {"x0": 0.07, "y0": 0.01, "x1": 0.93, "y1": 0.09}}], "ranked": ["watch_d/p008", "watch_d/p009", "watch_d/p002", "watch_d/p001", "watch_d/p013"], "pool": ["watch_d/p002", "watch_d/p008", "watch_d/p009", "watch_d/p001", "watch_d/p025", "watch_d/p013"], "ndcg_at_k": 1.0, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 1, "calls": 4, "tokens": 16212, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 5.33}
