{"kind": "question", "qid": "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763#1", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "['combshj@unk.edu']", "answer": "The email address on the document's second cover page is **combshj@unk.edu**. It appears on the preparation/credits page of the Hamilton County Nebraska Historic Buildings Survey, listed with the preparers' contact information (H. Jason Combs (PI), Anne M. Bauer, John T. Bauer; 501 West 28th Street, Kearney, Nebraska 68845; (308) 236-5137; combshj@unk.edu), with the report dated July 2009 and prepared for The Nebraska State Historical Society (doc_id 698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763, page 2).", "citations": [{"doc_id": "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763", "page": 2, "bbox": {"x0": 0.39, "y0": 0.565, "x1": 0.62, "y1": 0.585}}], "ranked": ["698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p002", "watch_d/p000", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p000", "2023.acl-long.386/p011", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p007"], "pool": ["watch_d/p000", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p000", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p007", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p005", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p006", "watch_d/p001", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p002", "2023.acl-long.386/p010", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p010", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p018", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p004", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p015", "watch_d/p024", "watch_d/p004", "watch_d/p022"], "ndcg_at_k": 1.0, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 2, "calls": 7, "tokens": 52388, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 13.066}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763#2", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "538", "answer": "Hamilton County covers approximately **538 square miles** (rounded integer: 538).\n\nThe survey states that \"Hamilton County covers approximately 538 square miles and elevations range from 1,660 feet above sea level in the eastern portion to nearly 1,900 feet in the west.\" This figure appears in the discussion of the county's location within the Central Loess Plains, citing Andreas (1882) in *The History of the State of Nebraska*.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763", "page": 10, "bbox": {"x0": 0.525, "y0": 0.585, "x1": 0.82, "y1": 0.625}}], "ranked": ["698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p016", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p013", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p010", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p009", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p014"], "pool": ["698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p010", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p016", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p014", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p013", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p008", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p009", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p008", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p018", "2023.acl-long.386/p009", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p017", "698bba535087fa9a7f9009e172a7f763/p011"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.5, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 5, "calls": 16, "tokens": 104657, "stop_reason": "recover_exhausted", "latency_s": 36.395}
