{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#1", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "2", "answer": "The paper's main body shows four prompt examples (templates) for closed-book fact-checking with InstructGPT: Direct Prompting, ZS-CoT Prompting, CoT Prompting, and Self-Ask Prompting. These are presented under \"Prompts for Closed-Book Fact-Checking,\" which states \"Below we show the templates for the four prompting methods used for InstructGPT for the closed-book fact-checking setting in Section 4.4\" (2023.acl-long.386/p014).", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 14, "bbox": {"x0": 0.525, "y0": 0.276, "x1": 0.966, "y1": 0.294}}, {"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 14, "bbox": {"x0": 0.525, "y0": 0.516, "x1": 0.969, "y1": 0.858}}, {"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 7, "bbox": {"x0": 0.519, "y0": 0.588, "x1": 0.973, "y1": 0.61}}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p003", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p022"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p003", "2023.acl-long.386/p022", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p015", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p000", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p013", "2023.acl-long.386/p005"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.5, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 0.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 0.0, "rounds": 3, "calls": 10, "tokens": 76260, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 25.44}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#2", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "1", "answer": "Based on the provided pages, the figure at the top of page 6985 is Figure 2 (the Codex prompt template). It contains 1 complete in-context example (the James Cameron / Interstellar example), followed by a placeholder \"(... more in-context examples here ...)\". Answer: 1.", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 4, "bbox": {"x0": 0.25, "y0": 0.05, "x1": 0.78, "y1": 0.31}}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p006", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p005"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p002", "2023.acl-long.386/p015", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p013", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p003", "0e94b4197b10096b1f4c699701570fbf/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "2023.acl-long.386/p000"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.5, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 5, "calls": 12, "tokens": 105964, "stop_reason": "", "latency_s": 34.15}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#3", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "Subtask", "answer": "The semantic error type with the lowest total percentage in the HOVER dataset is **Subtask** (missing/redundant/incorrect sub-task calls), which has the lowest proportion at every hop length: **2% for 2-hop, 5% for 3-hop, and 2% for 4-hop** claims.\n\nFor comparison, the other semantic error types have higher percentages:\n- **Token**: 8% (2-hop), 20% (3-hop), 18% (4-hop)\n- **Structure**: 19% (2-hop), 13% (3-hop), 57% (4-hop)\n\nAnd the other overall error category is **Incorrect execution** at 71% (2-hop), 62% (3-hop), and 23% (4-hop). There are no syntax errors (0% across all hop lengths).", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 7, "bbox": {"x0": 0.06, "y0": 0.28, "x1": 0.49, "y1": 0.44}}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p016", "2023.acl-long.386/p005"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p016", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p003", "2023.acl-long.386/p000", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "watch_d/p015", "watch_d/p016"], "ndcg_at_k": 1.0, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 5, "calls": 16, "tokens": 118943, "stop_reason": "recover_exhausted", "latency_s": 42.394}
{"kind": "question", "qid": "2023.acl-long.386#4", "hops": 1, "gold_answer": "56.8", "answer": "The dataset with the highest ProgramFC retrieval recall@10 is HOVER (4-hop), which reaches 89.65 recall@10 (vs. 77.13 for HOVER 2-hop, 59.17 for HOVER 3-hop, and 83.65 for FEVEROUS-S) (doc_id: 2023.acl-long.386, page 6, bbox: 0.052, 0.291, 0.444, 0.638).\n\nIn the closed-book setting, InstructGPT with Self-Ask achieves a macro-F1 of 52.45 on HOVER 4-hop (doc_id: 2023.acl-long.386, page 7, bbox: 0.502, 0.292, 0.894, 0.463).\n\nAnswer: 52.5", "citations": [{"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 6, "bbox": {"x0": 0.052, "y0": 0.291, "x1": 0.444, "y1": 0.638}}, {"doc_id": "2023.acl-long.386", "page": 7, "bbox": {"x0": 0.502, "y0": 0.292, "x1": 0.894, "y1": 0.463}}], "ranked": ["2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p006"], "pool": ["2023.acl-long.386/p006", "2023.acl-long.386/p005", "2023.acl-long.386/p002", "2023.acl-long.386/p008", "2023.acl-long.386/p001", "2023.acl-long.386/p007", "2023.acl-long.386/p014", "2023.acl-long.386/p004", "2023.acl-long.386/p013"], "ndcg_at_k": 0.8503, "recall_at_k": 1.0, "pool_recall": 1.0, "iou_at_threshold": 1.0, "bbox_hit_rate": 1.0, "rounds": 5, "calls": 14, "tokens": 94313, "stop_reason": "recover_exhausted", "latency_s": 58.226}
